    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale by Online Auction (UPS) on the pfq.ie auction platform, on Thursday 15th October at 11am\n\nBrought to the market by PF Quirke & Co, this charming property presents an exciting opportunity to transform a well-located house into something truly special. Whether you`re a first-time buyer eager to put your own stamp on a home, an experienced renovator, or a savvy investor searching for your next project, this property offers endless possibilities.\n\n\nIdeally situated in the heart of Fethard, just a short stroll from the town`s Main Street and only a 15 minute drive from Clonmel, you`ll enjoy the convenience of town centre living while remaining within easy reach of Clonmel and its many amenities.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance porch, a living/dining room, kitchen and bathroom on the ground floor, with two bedrooms on the first floor. To the rear, there is a private paved yard with convenient access for bins and general storage.\n\n Adding to its appeal, the property should qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, offering an excellent opportunity to offset renovation costs and maximise the homes potential.\n\n\nProperties with this level of potential, combined with a superb central location and the possibility of grant assistance, are becoming increasingly difficult to find. Whether you`re dreaming of creating your ideal home or looking for your next rewarding renovation project, Rosebay is ready for its next chapter - and it could be yours. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\nNB: To take part in the auction, you must register on www.pfq.ie and pay a pre-auction deposit. Contact us for details."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch - 1.03m (3'5\") x 1.06m (3'6\")\n\nDining/ Living room - 3.91m (12'10\") x 5.39m (17'8\")\n\nKitchen - 3.23m (10'7\") x 1.1m (3'7\")\n\nBathroom - 2.1m (6'11\") x 1.95m (6'5\")\n\nBedroom - 3.18m (10'5\") x 2.94m (9'8\")\n\nBedroom - 3.87m (12'8\") x 2.21m (7'3\")\n\nLanding - 0.95m (3'1\") x 1m (3'3\")\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
